--TEST--
there is no `__call` fallback, so a method the class does not declare is refused before anything runs — `rule:classes/property-observer-costs-nothing-when-unused`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Box {
    public int $n;

    public function constructor(int $n) {
        $this->n = $n;
    }
}
var $b = new Box(1);
echo $b->widen(2), "\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0405]: `Box` has no method named `widen`
   --> case.nvs:10:6
